    # orcid: ""  # TODO: register at orcid.org and fill in. Checked 2026-08-30:
    # no public ORCID record exists under this name, and the 2017 PLoS ONE
    # paper carries none for any author.
repository-code: "https://github.com/michellejw/ooi-fin-whales"
abstract: >-
  Extending a 2003-2013 fin whale call time series into the present using an
  automated detector, on continuous seafloor seismometer data from the
  Endeavour segment of the Juan de Fuca Ridge. Measures inter-pulse interval
  and peak frequency of the 20 Hz call, and compares a modern detector against
  the matched filter used in the original study on identical audio.
keywords:
  - bioacoustics
  - fin whale
  - Balaenoptera physalus
  - passive acoustic monitoring
  - Juan de Fuca Ridge
license: MIT
